   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is there any way to filter data graphically using the mouse in the user interface like done here <a href=\"http://bl.ocks.org/mbostock/4063663\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bl.ocks.org/mbostock/4063663&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399444130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Kh-ycj-xIXX3yF4j476q6\">http://bl.ocks.org/mbostock/4063663</a><br>If not, are there any plans to include something like that in the near future ?<br>Best regards and thanks in advance<br>Wolfgang<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
